      "make": "Shapes > Rectangle dragged (35,30)-(65,70) mm (portrait); region Spiral Stitch. Hoop 100 x 100 mm page (File > New); line Not Sewn (Line); colour 800 EMBROIDERY RED; region at its defaults (Density 2,0 line/mm, Run pitch 2,0 mm, Start Point first button); nothing else in the design. Save As PES (default type, #PES0110). Status bar 29,90 x 39,70 mm, 1286 st."
    }
  ],
